  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "How will Mauricio Pochettino change Manchester United?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "red",
        "person": {
          "image": "pochettino"
        },
        "name": "MAURICIO POCHETTINO",
        "scale": 1.3
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, first, look at what he's walking into.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "dejected"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Michael Carrick is gone, after a four-all draw with Aston Villa.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "purple",
        "person": {
          "image": "carrick"
        },
        "name": "MICHAEL CARRICK",
        "stamp": "SACKED"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "United are eighteenth, with eight points from ten games.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "table",
        "bg": "navy",
        "rows": [
          {
            "pos": 17,
            "name": "Coventry City",
            "pts": 9
          },
          {
            "pos": 18,
            "name": "Man United",
            "pts": 8,
            "hi": true,
            "zone": true
          },
          {
            "pos": 19,
            "name": "Sunderland",
            "pts": 8,
            "zone": true
          },
          {
            "pos": 20,
            "name": "Crystal Palace",
            "pts": 7,
            "zone": true
          }
        ],
        "zoneFrom": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One win. Five draws. Four defeats.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "tiles",
        "bg": "navy",
        "title": "10 GAMES",
        "results": [
          "W",
          "D",
          "D",
          "D",
          "D",
          "D",
          "L",
          "L",
          "L",
          "L"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And United have looked at Pochettino before.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "teal",
        "person": {
          "image": "pochettino"
        },
        "name": "POCHETTINO"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In 2019, and again in 2022. Both times, they went elsewhere.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "years",
        "bg": "purple",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "2019",
            "top": "UNITED",
            "label": "Kept Solskjær",
            "cross": true
          },
          {
            "year": "2022",
            "top": "UNITED",
            "label": "Chose Ten Hag",
            "cross": true
          },
          {
            "year": "2026",
            "top": "UNITED",
            "label": "Pochettino",
            "tick": true,
            "head": "#1ea85a"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, he's got two and a half years.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "teal",
        "prop": "contract",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 2.5,
        "dec": 1,
        "fmt": "{v}",
        "word": "YEARS",
        "size": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So what does a Pochettino team look like? Usually, a four-two-three-one.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "formation",
        "bg": "green",
        "label": "4-2-3-1"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And it presses. Hard. Win the ball high, then attack fast.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "press",
        "bg": "green",
        "won": "WON IT HIGH"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He learned that from Marcelo Bielsa, who coached him as a player.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "mentor",
        "bg": "orange",
        "left": {
          "image": "bielsa"
        },
        "leftName": "BIELSA",
        "right": {
          "image": "pochettino"
        },
        "rightName": "POCHETTINO",
        "caption": "COACH  →  PLAYER"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The full-backs give the width, so the wingers can come inside.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "width",
        "bg": "green"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "At Tottenham, that meant eighty-six points, and a Champions League final.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "blue",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 86,
        "word": "POINTS · 2016/17",
        "size": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "At Paris Saint-Germain, he won three trophies, including Ligue 1.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "shelf",
        "bg": "blue",
        "title": "AT PSG",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Trophée des Champions",
            "year": "2021",
            "kind": "plate",
            "col": "#d9dde3"
          },
          {
            "label": "Coupe de France",
            "year": "2021",
            "kind": "cup"
          },
          {
            "label": "Ligue 1",
            "year": "2022",
            "kind": "bigears",
            "col": "#d9dde3"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His first game? Liverpool. The team that beat him in that final.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "fixture",
        "bg": "red",
        "then": {
          "top": "2019 CHAMPIONS LEAGUE FINAL",
          "score": "SPURS 0-2 LIVERPOOL",
          "foot": "MADRID"
        },
        "now": {
          "top": "SUNDAY 22 NOVEMBER",
          "teams": "LIVERPOOL v MAN UTD",
          "foot": "ANFIELD"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He gets four days with the squad before Anfield.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "red",
        "prop": "calendar",
        "top": "NOVEMBER",
        "from": 18,
        "to": 22
      }
    }
  ],
